                                                "sense_id": "2f82c34c-e1aa-3055-8345-f2bce5c6ecdf",
                                                "text": "I hope you didn't take it the wrong way, that was a figure of speech."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
